  "$comment": [
    "Reference macro indicators that no free market feed publishes — policy",
    "rates and official statistics. These used to be bare string literals in the",
    "component, so nothing on screen told you how old they were.",
    "",
    "Every entry now carries `asOf` (the release the figure comes from) and",
    "`staleAfterDays`. Past that age the desk renders the figure dimmed with a",
    "'확인 필요' marker instead of quietly presenting a stale number as current.",
    "",
    "Set `asOf` to null when a figure has not been verified — the panel will say",
    "so rather than implying it is fresh. Update this file after each release."
  ],

